Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Build05 journey occlusion: re-place bridges, path-frame
 follow lens, geometry test
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Oi FAIL 2026-10-16 (Build05 3bda6a93):
- 04→05 ~3.32 m: beach_palm_tall close-up hides her and the bridge.
- 08→09: grey platform ahead; late leg she is invisible (foot ~2.27 m below
  env_sky_static_palette top at 32.22 m per Oi; 5.98 m worst in this harness).

Root causes
- 04→05: straight +Z approach put the bridge's first metres under
  beach_palm_tall's canopy and through env_prop_palm_lean_01's trunk; the
  world-fixed lens offset (+3.6,+3.4,-6.2) parks the canopy between lens and
  her, and the 4 m blend from the far island pose swept the lens through the
  canopy (0.96 m clearance at d≈3.0 m).
- 08→09: the rainbow bridge landed on anchor_cloudbridge_end, the INNER edge of
  the city's round terminus platform, so its last ~13 m climbed beneath that
  platform and its 4.4 m centre post. The city also sat over the meadow's far
  half (windmill through the city).

Fix (RegionJourneyLayout.ts new, engine-free; adapter uses it)
- Island approach ends at +0.8 m X: the 2.1 m bridge threads both trunks.
- City yawed so its own cloud bridge faces the meadow exit (heading +X), the
  platform OUTER rim is placed at walk_path_08 + [24,12,0]; she walks the deck
  around the post (measured deck heights) onto the cloud-bridge deck and stops
  at the SAME arrival root (2.4 m from anchor_cloudbridge_end) as Build05.
- RegionJourneyCore.journeyCamera: offset in the path frame (back 6.2, left 3,
  up 5, heading smoothed ±3 m) and a 5.5 m lift arc during the 4 m blend-in.

09 arrival plaza composition: SkycityBoardBackground / SkycityVisitPose are
untouched (own camera, never writes the world lens); the test pins their
sources and pose and checks the plaza corners stay in frame.

Test: tools/journey-integration/test-journey-occlusion.cjs (added to the
suite) samples both legs every 0.05 m against real GLB triangles.
Leg 08→09 is longer: 42.87 m → 59.27 m (deck walk), ~13.7 s more at 1.2 m/s.
Leg 04→05: 32.37 m → 32.46 m.
